# only with KERNEL=6.18 (tools/build_kernel_modules.sh). The same files from
# inMusic's public 6.18.45 release brought to 6.18.59 with kernel.org's stable
# increments, with kernel/uvc's "sample-base:" changes in f_uvc.c, uvc_v4l2.c
# and uvc.h.
obj-m := sample_base_uvc.o
